  - title: 03 / Compensate for roll growth
    explanation: The feed roll shrinks while the take-up roll grows. Watch their
      RPM ratio change. Apply the feed brake and watch the take-up drive ease back
      as the dancer moves toward high tension.
    caption: "SURFACE SPEED = ANGULAR SPEED \xD7 RADIUS"
    parts:
    - id: source
      kind: 9
      position: {x: 0.12, y: 0.8}
