  - title: 04 / Recover from a sensor fault
    explanation: Remove W15 while winding. Restore it, wait for safe stationary feedback,
      explicitly reset the fault and start AUTO again.
    caption: "W15 OPEN  \u2022  BOTH DRIVES STOP"
